{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":310,"mirrow":false,"y":-286,"img":"chara033_1","addImg":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1f"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":310,"mirrow":false,"y":-286,"img":"chara033_1","addImg":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1f"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]每次看到懒洋洋的史莱姆，我就想起我那个呆瓜妹妹，她也总是这样迷迷糊糊的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]她连站岗时也是这副样子，我总担心她会突然睡着倒下去，真是个不省心的家伙呀。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]不过她认真起来还是很强的。和我不一样，她的秘术师天赋是我们这届最强的。[r]只要挥几下法杖，就能放出强力的范围攻击魔法！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]唉，和她相比，我这点魔力根本不算什么……不过那又怎样，没有我这个姐姐在前面抵挡魔物，她肯定没法独自战斗的……吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]你、你也同意嘛？嘿、嘿嘿，看来她还是要依赖我的啊！[r]真没办法，谁让我是姐姐呢～！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"乌帕-友善3","script":"yd_033_03"}